{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/create-project","title":"Create a CraftTS project","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"create-a-craftts-project","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Create a CraftTS project"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"craft create"},{"t":"text","text":" to generate a framework-independent CraftTS application"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with routing, a typed API example, linting, tests, and the architecture"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"contract already wired up."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"prerequisites","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Prerequisites"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The beta toolchain requires Node.js 20.19 or newer. The "},{"t":"code","text":"craft"},{"t":"text","text":" executable is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"published by "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools"},{"t":"text","text":"; it is not provided by the unrelated npm"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"package named "},{"t":"code","text":"craft"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For a new project, invoke the executable explicitly through "},{"t":"code","text":"npx"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"my-app","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The first "},{"t":"code","text":"--yes"},{"t":"text","text":" belongs to "},{"t":"code","text":"npx"},{"t":"text","text":": it accepts the temporary package"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"installation. The command remains interactive because "},{"t":"code","text":"craft create"},{"t":"text","text":" itself"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"was not given "},{"t":"code","text":"--yes"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The command uses the published "},{"t":"code","text":"beta"},{"t":"text","text":" package. A checkout of CraftTS can"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"contain a newer creation flow than the version currently published on npm;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"check the resolved version with "},{"t":"code","text":"npm view @craft-ts/dev-tools@beta version"},{"t":"text","text":" if"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the prompts shown by your terminal do not match this page."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"interactive-creation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Interactive creation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Run the command in a real terminal without "},{"t":"code","text":"craft create --yes"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"my-app","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The generator presents menus in this order:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the application type: frontend-only or full-stack;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"for a full-stack app, the backend runtime: "},{"t":"code","text":"promise"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"effect"},{"t":"text","text":" (EffectTS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"v4 is recommended);"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the frontend runtime: "},{"t":"code","text":"plain"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"effect"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"type-safe i18n, its locales, and its default locale;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the design system;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"typed CSS;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"a standalone or Nx workspace;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"integrations for Codex, Cursor, or Claude Code."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The frontend and backend choices are independent. The frontend choice controls"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"whether CraftTS's Effect adapter is installed in the browser; the backend"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"choice controls only the server functions. To use EffectTS v4 on the backend"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"while keeping the browser on base CraftTS, choose "},{"t":"code","text":"plain"},{"t":"text","text":" for the frontend and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"effect"},{"t":"text","text":" for the backend. This generates no Effect adapter or Effect imports in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the browser app."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Frontend choice"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Backend choice"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Effect adapter in browser"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"plain"}],[{"t":"code","text":"effect"}],[{"t":"text","text":"No"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"effect"}],[{"t":"code","text":"effect"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Yes"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"↑"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"↓"},{"t":"text","text":" to move and "},{"t":"code","text":"Enter"},{"t":"text","text":" to confirm a single choice. For locales and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"agent integrations, use "},{"t":"code","text":"Space"},{"t":"text","text":" to select or deselect several items, then"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"Enter"},{"t":"text","text":" to confirm. The project directory remains a text field because it is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a free-form path. If the directory is omitted, the generator asks for it too:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The agent question is a multi-selection list. Use "},{"t":"code","text":"↑"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"↓"},{"t":"text","text":" to move, "},{"t":"code","text":"Space"},{"t":"text","text":" to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"select or deselect an integration, and "},{"t":"code","text":"Enter"},{"t":"text","text":" to confirm. Codex starts"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"selected, preserving the default used by scripted creation. Every starter"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"receives an "},{"t":"code","text":"AGENTS.md"},{"t":"text","text":" project guide describing its selected runtimes and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"features; selected integrations additionally receive their editor-specific"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"project instructions and skills. Claude Code receives "},{"t":"code","text":"CLAUDE.md"},{"t":"text","text":" and skills"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"under "},{"t":"code","text":".claude/skills/"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"agent-assisted-creation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Agent-assisted creation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When an agent starts a new project, it should first ask what kind of"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"application is being built and what its main features are, without collecting"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"detailed requirements yet. If those features imply a backend, it should"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"propose EffectTS v4 for the backend and explain that its typed services, Layers"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and errors fit CraftTS's typed server boundary. The user can confirm that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stack, reject it, or name another backend; the agent must not add an EffectTS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"backend after an explicit rejection."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The agent should create a domain-ready but empty starter with the design"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"system, typed CSS and strict i18n enabled, and without the explanatory demo"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"pages:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"my-app","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--no-demos","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--domain","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"app","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--frontend-runtime=plain","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--backend-runtime=effect","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--i18n=strict","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--design-system=basic","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--references=all","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--agents=codex","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"--backend-runtime=none"},{"t":"text","text":" when the user declines a backend, or the explicit"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"requested backend when it is supported. When no Effect runtime is selected,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"use "},{"t":"code","text":"--references=craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":" instead of "},{"t":"code","text":"--references=all"},{"t":"text","text":". The "},{"t":"code","text":"--no-demos"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"starter still"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"contains the architecture/tooling baseline and a domain boundary, but no"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"prefilled product pages or demo content."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"creating-inside-an-existing-git-repository","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Creating inside an existing Git repository"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An existing "},{"t":"code","text":".git"},{"t":"text","text":" directory makes the destination non-empty. Generate into"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the current repository with "},{"t":"code","text":"--force"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"cd","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"pet-foster-family","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":".","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--force","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"--force"},{"t":"text","text":" only permits writing into a non-empty destination; it does not turn"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"off the configuration prompts. Review generated file changes before"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"committing when the repository already contains application code."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"During the interactive flow, reference sources are vendored automatically with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"git subtree"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"CraftTS sources go into "},{"t":"code","text":".references/craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"EffectTS sources are also vendored when an Effect frontend or backend is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"selected;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the sources are committed in the project repository for agents without"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"replacing the installed npm packages."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"There is no reference confirmation prompt. The same defaults apply in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"non-interactive mode: CraftTS is vendored, and EffectTS is vendored whenever an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Effect frontend or backend is selected. Use "},{"t":"code","text":"--references=none"},{"t":"text","text":" to opt out, or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"--references=craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"--references=all"},{"t":"text","text":" to choose explicitly."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The vendored repositories are read-only reference material for coding agents"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"only. The generated application always imports the published CraftTS and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"EffectTS npm packages from "},{"t":"code","text":"package.json"},{"t":"text","text":"; it does not use "},{"t":"code","text":"file:"},{"t":"text","text":" dependencies"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"or TypeScript/Vite aliases to the references. Use "},{"t":"code","text":"npm run update:references"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"to run "},{"t":"code","text":"git subtree pull"},{"t":"text","text":" and refresh the recorded source SHA."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"non-interactive-creation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Non-interactive creation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass "},{"t":"code","text":"--yes"},{"t":"text","text":" after "},{"t":"code","text":"create"},{"t":"text","text":" to use defaults and disable all prompts. Combine it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with explicit options when the generated configuration must be reproducible:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"my-app","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--effect=none","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--agents=codex","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For a minimal plain starter:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"my-app","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--effect=none","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--i18n=none","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--design-system=none","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--agents=none","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"To create a backend-only Effect project and vendor both reference sources:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"my-app","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--frontend-runtime=plain","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--backend-runtime=effect","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--references=all","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The main configuration options are:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Option"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Values"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Purpose"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"--effect"}],[{"t":"code","text":"v4"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"none"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Select the Effect v4 or plain starter"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--frontend-runtime"}],[{"t":"code","text":"plain"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"effect"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Choose whether to install the Effect adapter in the browser"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--backend-runtime"}],[{"t":"code","text":"none"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"promise"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"effect"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Choose server functions independently of the frontend"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--effect-scope"}],[{"t":"code","text":"none"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"frontend"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"backend"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"both"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Set Effect placement"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--agents"}],[{"t":"text","text":"comma-separated names or "},{"t":"code","text":"none"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Add editor-specific agent integrations; "},{"t":"code","text":"AGENTS.md"},{"t":"text","text":" is always generated"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--i18n"}],[{"t":"code","text":"strict"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"loose"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"none"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Configure type-safe i18n"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--design-system"}],[{"t":"code","text":"basic"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"none"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Include the design-system starter"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--workspace"}],[{"t":"code","text":"standalone"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"nx"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Choose the workspace layout"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--references"}],[{"t":"code","text":"none"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"all"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Include source references (default: CraftTS, plus EffectTS when selected)"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--no-demos"}],[{"t":"text","text":"flag"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Generate a domain feature without explanatory demo pages"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--domain"}],[{"t":"text","text":"slug"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Name the first domain feature when using "},{"t":"code","text":"--no-demos"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--force"}],[{"t":"text","text":"flag"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Allow an existing non-empty destination"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"--json"}],[{"t":"text","text":"flag"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Print the effective configuration as JSON"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every project styles through "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/style"},{"t":"text","text":", whatever the options: there is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"no plain-CSS starter and no "},{"t":"code","text":"src/styles.css"},{"t":"text","text":". The element defaults and the app"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"shell live in "},{"t":"code","text":"src/app/app.style.ts"},{"t":"text","text":"; "},{"t":"code","text":"--design-system=basic"},{"t":"text","text":" adds the starter"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"design system in "},{"t":"code","text":"src/app/ui/ui.style.ts"},{"t":"text","text":". "},{"t":"code","text":"--no-typed-css"},{"t":"text","text":" is no longer"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"accepted."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"craft create --help"},{"t":"text","text":" to see the complete list:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--help","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For a domain-first starting point, omit the explanatory home/services/about"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"pages and name the feature explicitly:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--package","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools@beta","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"pet-foster","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--yes","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--no-demos","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--domain","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"animal","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--frontend-runtime=effect","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"--backend-runtime=effect","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The generated feature lives under "},{"t":"code","text":"src/app/features/animal/"},{"t":"text","text":". Add a form to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that feature with the existing primitives and its unit/submission test:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"craft","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"add","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"form","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"animal","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"# advanced nested/schema variant:","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"craft","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"add","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"form","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"animal","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--advanced","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"after-generation","children":[{"t":"text","text":"After generation"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The generator creates a Git repository when the destination is not already"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"inside another repository. When references are enabled, it adds them as"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"tracked Git subtrees and creates the minimal Git history required by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"git subtree"},{"t":"text","text":" when the destination is a new repository. The generated"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":".gitignore"},{"t":"text","text":" excludes "},{"t":"code","text":"node_modules/"},{"t":"text","text":", build outputs, and test reports."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Install dependencies and start the generated application:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"cd","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"my-app","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"install","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"dev","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The generated project also includes the following checks:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"lint","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"typecheck","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"test","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"architecture","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"build","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"npm-run-style-check","children":[{"t":"code","text":"npm run style:check"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"With typed CSS enabled, the project gets one more, and it is the only one that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"needs explaining:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"style:check","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It builds once — which is how the style plugin writes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":".craft/style-graph.json"},{"t":"text","text":" — then proves WCAG 2.2 AA "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"text contrast"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"every element the graph can show holds text, in every state your axes can"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"produce, with no browser involved. It is in the generated CI workflow."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The starter is set up to pass it out of the box: the palette is named, so a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"failure can say "},{"t":"code","text":"ui.accent.dangerHover"},{"t":"text","text":" rather than a hexadecimal string, and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the generated link writes its hovered colour through "},{"t":"code","text":"interaction.hover"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rather than a hand-written selector, so the hovered state is a state the check"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"can actually measure."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two things to know before your first failure:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A result the analysis cannot prove fails the run."}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"--allow-indeterminate"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"turns those into warnings and you have to type it. A check whose default"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"treats \"I could not tell\" as \"fine\" reports a clean bill on the part of the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"application it did not understand."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A clean run is a contrast proof, not an accessibility audit."}]},{"t":"text","text":""}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/contrast","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Text contrast"}]},{"t":"text","text":" has the full coverage contract: what is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"proven, what comes back as "},{"t":"code","text":"indeterminate"},{"t":"text","text":", and how to close a gap honestly."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"generated-architecture-rules","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Generated architecture rules"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The generated "},{"t":"code","text":"eslint.config.mjs"},{"t":"text","text":" imports "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools/eslint-rules"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and activates the selected "},{"t":"code","text":"recommended"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"effect"},{"t":"text","text":" preset. These presets"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"enforce the same architecture as the generated project guide:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"remote reads and writes stay directly in query or mutation loaders; they"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"must not be hidden in "},{"t":"code","text":"craftMethod"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"query"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"mutation"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcess"},{"t":"text","text":" loaders are generator functions;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"express asynchronous work with "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":", never with "},{"t":"code","text":"async"},{"t":"text","text":" or a native"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"Promise"},{"t":"text","text":" return;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"resource loaders infer their result instead of using casts such as"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"as PromiseLike<...>"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"route-visible filters, search, sort and pagination use route-level"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"queryParams"},{"t":"text","text":", not component-local "},{"t":"code","text":"state"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"template event handlers emit one "},{"t":"code","text":"source$"},{"t":"text","text":"; query, mutation and state react"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"through "},{"t":"code","text":"on$"},{"t":"text","text":" instead of chaining imperative method calls."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The generated agent skill repeats these boundaries so new features follow the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"same rules. Run "},{"t":"code","text":"npm run lint"},{"t":"text","text":" after generation to verify the project."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"With a backend, "},{"t":"code","text":"src/server/application.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" owns the registry and runtime"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Layer, while "},{"t":"code","text":"src/server/node-http.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" is only the Node stream adapter."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"server.ts"},{"t":"text","text":" re-exports both for compatibility. In the backend-only Effect"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"profile, the browser remains plain CraftTS; Effect services, middleware and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"error projections stay under the server boundary."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"troubleshooting","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Troubleshooting"}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"could-not-determine-executable-to-run","children":[{"t":"code","text":"could not determine executable to run"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If the error mentions "},{"t":"code","text":"craft@0.1.0"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"npx"},{"t":"text","text":" resolved the unrelated public npm"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"package named "},{"t":"code","text":"craft"},{"t":"text","text":". Use the explicit "},{"t":"code","text":"--package @craft-ts/dev-tools@beta"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"form shown above."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools"},{"t":"text","text":" is already installed in the project, its local binary"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"can also be called with:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npx","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craft","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"create","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"my-app","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The explicit form is still the safest command when bootstrapping a project"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that has no "},{"t":"code","text":"package.json"},{"t":"text","text":" yet."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"prerequisites","text":"Prerequisites"},{"level":2,"id":"interactive-creation","text":"Interactive creation"},{"level":2,"id":"agent-assisted-creation","text":"Agent-assisted creation"},{"level":3,"id":"creating-inside-an-existing-git-repository","text":"Creating inside an existing Git repository"},{"level":2,"id":"non-interactive-creation","text":"Non-interactive creation"},{"level":2,"id":"after-generation","text":"After generation"},{"level":3,"id":"npm-run-style-check","text":"npm run style:check"},{"level":3,"id":"generated-architecture-rules","text":"Generated architecture rules"},{"level":2,"id":"troubleshooting","text":"Troubleshooting"},{"level":3,"id":"could-not-determine-executable-to-run","text":"could not determine executable to run"}]}